The closest match is 'device process'. Help on it follows.

Commands to query and attach to processes on a device.

Syntax: device process [attach|list] ...

The following subcommands are supported:

      attach -- Attach to a process on a device.
      list   -- List processes on the given device.

For more help on any particular subcommand, type 'help <command> <subcommand>'.
